  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the coffee value chain learning event</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the project is to organize a learning event with the aim of identifying opportunities and impediments for Norwegian companies to invest in a sustainable deforestation free forest coffee value chain in light of the recently adopted EU sustainability regulations. More specifically, the aim is to explore what is needed to ensure improved access for Norwegian importers including access to direct trade with small holder forest coffee farmers.</narrative>
  </description>
